{"duration_api_ms": 54801, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "e01a6bc4-a851-4b3a-b3cd-d47b364a53b7", "total_cost_usd": 0.08035591, "usage": {"input_tokens": 4, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3214, "cache_read_input_tokens": 46186, "output_tokens": 506, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3214, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "global", "iterations": [{"input_tokens": 2, "output_tokens": 421, "cache_read_input_tokens": 23661, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 2078, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 2078}, "type": "message"}], "speed": "standard", "fallback_credit": null}, "modelUsage": {"claude-sonnet-5-5": {"inputTokens": 12, "outputTokens": 2100, "cacheReadInputTokens": 120300, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 10532, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.07518200000000001, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 0, "canonicalModel": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}, "claude-haiku-5-5": {"inputTokens": 12, "outputTokens": 4015, "cacheReadInputTokens": 92896, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 17890, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 0.0051739099999999994, "contextWindow": 1000000, "maxOutputTokens": 128000, "thinkingTokens": 210, "canonicalModel": "claude-haiku-5-5", "provider": "firstParty", "costBasis": "list"}}, "permission_denials": [], "terminal_reason": "completed", "fast_mode_state": "off", "fast_mode_disabled_reason": "sdk_opt_in_required", "origin": {"kind": "task-notification", "producer": "session-task", "runId": "0mvb0usk3-b31fdd00"}, "subagent_stats": {"spawned": 1, "requested": {"background": 0, "foreground": 0, "unset": 1}, "started_in_background": 1, "max_depth": 1, "spawned_by_subagents": 0, "completed": 1, "failed": 0, "killed": {"parent": 0, "user": 0, "system": 0}, "refused": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "`execute-write` now accepts `create view` and `drop view`, gated by two new permissions. `create-view` is checked on the database, and `drop-view` on the view as a table resource. An actor without the right permission gets a 403 naming the missing one.\n\nI reviewed the implementer's diff against the spec and it matches. I also reran `.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/test_queries.py` myself: 90 passed. The implementer additionally ran `tests/test_docs.py`, `tests/test_permissions.py` and `tests/test_internals_datasette.py`, which passed; I did not rerun those.\n\n- **Actions:** `create-view` and `drop-view` are registered in `datasette/default_actions.py`.\n- **Mapping:** `decision_for_write_sql_operation` in `datasette/write_sql.py` maps the two statements to those actions.\n- **Spurious delete:** `datasette/utils/sql_analysis.py` now suppresses the authorizer's delete on a dropped view's name, as it already did for tables. The set is renamed `dropped_tables_and_views`, so it no longer becomes a `delete-row` requirement.\n- **Docs:** `docs/authentication.rst` lists both permissions under `--root` and has a section for each.", "ttft_ms": 7093, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 14476, "uuid": "56a99563-f639-4fd9-a54b-b4fea4a36f01", "ttft_stream_ms": 6782, "time_to_request_ms": 15, "first_content_frame_ms": 6782, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
